  "limits": "Four-legged rectangular tables only; no pedestal, drawers, stretchers or joinery detail. Turned legs use one fixed bead profile scaled to the leg size. Parts touch but are not merged, and edges are sharp without bevels. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
